 "protocol": [
  "Block free thiols with NEM at pH 6.5 before lysis.",
  "NO reduction and NO iodoacetamide: carbamidomethyl as a fixed modification is what destroys disulfide connectivity in every published SOD1 dataset.",
  "Digest with Glu-C at pH 6.5-7.0, not the usual pH 8 ammonium bicarbonate, which generates deamidation and promotes thiol-disulfide exchange in the tube.",
  "Run a matched pH 8 aliquot as the artefact control.",
  "Post-mortem interval is a covariate for every deamidation readout."
 ]
